{{Further|Blox Fruits}}
'''Natural''' is one of the three classifications of [[Blox Fruits]], alongside [[Elemental]] and [[Beast]]. Natural fruits grant the user a wide variety of powers that do not fall strictly into elemental control or beast transformations. These abilities are often considered “superpower” types, ranging from [[Gravity|gravitational manipulation]] and [[Magnet|magnetic mechanics]] and [[Spider|string control]] to [[Creation|creative building]] and [[Sound|sound waves]]. There are currently 22 Natural fruits in the game.

<center><h2>Natural Fruits</h2></center>
{{Blox Fruit/Natural|center=1}}

==Notes==
* Natural fruits are an all-rounder kind of fruit, meaning that the player could use them both for ranged and close combat.
* Natural fruits are great for PvP because of their high-damaging moves and outputs.
* The [[Chef]] has a 1/3 chance to deflect [[Swords|sword]] attacks, due to him using [[Blade]] to deflect sword attacks, regardless of [[Aura]]. He is recommended to be defeated with [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]], [[guns]], or [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] attacks.
* Players with [[Blade]] are immune from [[Swords|sword]] attacks even those with [[Aura]]].
* [[Blade]] and [[Rubber]] are the only Natural-type fruits that grant immunity (to [[Swords]], [[Guns]], [[Lightning]] [[Blox Fruits|fruit]], and [[Electric]] [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]], respectively).
* [[Spider]] and [[Quake]] are the only Natural-type fruits to have an [[Raids|awakening]].
* [[Diamond]], [[Rubber]], [[Venom]] and [[Magnet]] are the only natural type fruits to have a [[transformation]].
* [[Portal]] has the best travel abilities throughout the game. It is highly recommended for [[Swords|Sword]] or [[Guns|Gun]] users.
* Natural Type currently has the most revamped/reworked fruits in the game, with a total of 12 revamped/reworked, possibly due to being the majority of the fruits.
* [[Dough]] used to be a Natural fruit before being changed to an Elemental one, although it had a mechanic that made it similar to Elemental fruits, with the only difference being that it required [[Instinct]] to be turned on.
* [[Pain]], [[Bomb]], [[Control]] and [[Magnet]] are currently the newest Natural type fruits in-game.

==Trivia==
* Natural-type [[Blox Fruits]] are not any different from other fruits; it is only a classification, unlike [[Elemental]] fruits, which provide the user with immunity to physical attacks.

